  "title": "Supplementary Table S7. Formal EVI × O₃ interaction and ozone-stratified EVI association estimates",
  "panel": "",
  "panel_title": "",
  "notes_before": [],
  "notes_after": [
    "Note. The EVI × O₃ product term in the linear BAA model tests departure from additivity of mean BAA differences. EVI at low O₃ and EVI at high O₃ are EVI coefficients from separate stratified fits within low- and high-O₃ strata; EVI difference tests whether these stratum-specific estimates differ. These adjusted associations do not establish causal effect modification. The product-term fit, the stratum-specific estimates, the four-group difference-in-differences contrast (Table S16) and the continuous product term (Table S20) quantify the same additivity departure under different exposure parameterisations and weighting schemes and are not expected to coincide numerically; none provided precise evidence of effect modification.",
    "Abbreviations: BAA, biological age acceleration; EVI, enhanced vegetation index; O₃, ozone."
  ],
